{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年7月16日 12:02 星期四</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>天文台特別天氣提示：珠江口一帶持續有雷雨區發展，預料未來一兩小時本港廣泛地區可能受大雨影響，市民應提高警覺。（天文台）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T04:38:39.594753+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none"}}